==English==

===Pronunciation===
quan·ti·za·tion
* {{AHD|/kwântĭzāshôn/}}

===Etymology===
{{L.}} ''[[quantum|quant(um)]]'' + “[[-ization]]”

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|-}}

# {{uncountable}} the [[process]] of [[approximating]] a [[continuous]] [[signal]] by a [[set]] of [[discrete]] [[symbol]]s or [[integer]] [[value]]s
#{{context|physics|countable}} a [[procedure]] for [[constructing]] a [[quantum field theory]] starting from a [[classical field theory]].

